	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES:\nThe TIMEPULSE pin outputs a clock (default 1Hz, can be changed using the CFG-TP-* config. group (see datasheet page 48 (section 3.9 time pulse))). However, on startup it also shares the same internal IC as SAFE_BOOT_N. If the pin is low at startup, the receiver will enter safeboot mode, so make sure that there is no load that could pull the pin low at startup."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.185 96.52 0)
		(size 71.12 36.195)
		(margins 1.8 1.8 1.8 1.8)
